vaft-matlab: macOS fix for IMAS-Core's al_env.sh
================================================

Applied by install/install_imas_matlab.sh to a *copy* of the IMAS-Core
tree on macOS only. The installed bin/al_env.sh is generated from
IMAS-Core's common/al_env.sh.in, which reads the Data Dictionary version
with `grep -P`. BSD grep has no -P, so IMAS_VERSION ends up empty on
macOS. This one-line change reads it with sed instead.

Tested on IMAS-Core 1c58af48 (5.6.0-1); applies to develop fd7ef3d7 and
main ad0f2e29.

License: this file is a modification of IMAS-Core and is distributed under
